Subject: [PATCH 26/41] tracker: state written atomically (temp + rename, CRC
 in a 0.7.6 extension under the v7 magic), counter bound in the key page, boot
 counter = max of state, key page and key epoch; TX floor 3250 mV (resume 3350
 mV or USB), boot report after 30 s with backoff after resets in a row,
 low-battery report and DM once per crossing (flags in the state, armed again
 at 20 %); Track/Lost interval at least 120 s, rolling 200 floods/24 h cap
 (fallback max(IDLE, 1 h)), LOST x2 after 2 h at one place; dfu
 serial|ble|uf2; status txcap line

